> References

- [Bordes et al. (2013), Translating Embeddings for Modeling Multi-relational Data](https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper/2013/file/1cecc7a77928ca8133fa24680a88d2f9-Paper.pdf).
- [Yang et al. (2015), Embedding Entities and Relations for Learning and Inference in Knowledge Bases](https://arxiv.org/abs/1412.6575).
- [Trouillon et al. (2016), Complex Embeddings for Simple Link Prediction](https://arxiv.org/abs/1606.06357).
- [Sun et al. (2019), RotatE](https://arxiv.org/abs/1902.10197).
